WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.868
The stream moved fast!

2
00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:16.243
Rex flapped his arms.

3
00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:21.403
He swam toward the log.

4
00:00:21.404 --> 00:00:26.514
Sara and Sid were near Rex.

5
00:00:26.515 --> 00:00:30.073
"Help!" Sara cried.

6
00:00:30.074 --> 00:00:32.943
Rex grabbed the log.

7
00:00:32.944 --> 00:00:36.611
"Take my hand," Rex said.

8
00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:40.601
Rex pulled Sara to the log.

9
00:00:40.602 --> 00:00:44.402
Sid swam to the log.

10
00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:47.061
"Whew!" Sid said.

11
00:00:47.062 --> 00:00:51.306
"Now we can just float."

12
00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:53.583
Rex gulped.

13
00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:57.282
"We can't float for long," he said.

14
00:00:57.283 --> 00:00:59.805
"I see a waterfall!"

15
00:00:59.806 --> 00:01:04.454
"Ahh!" Sara and Sid cried.

16
00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:08.610
The buddies went over the waterfall.

17
00:01:08.611 --> 00:01:11.129
But it wasn't very big.

18
00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.052
"Whee!" Sara said.

19
00:01:14.053 --> 00:01:18.546
Splash!

20
00:01:18.547 --> 00:01:23.891
"That was fun!" Sid said.

21
00:01:23.892 --> 00:01:26.948
The stream was slow now.

22
00:01:26.949 --> 00:01:32.395
Rex grinned. "We're safe.

23
00:01:32.396 --> 00:01:37.793
But where's Tor?"

24
00:01:37.794 --> 00:01:41.080
"Over here!" Tor said.

25
00:01:41.081 --> 00:01:44.593
Rex looked.

26
00:01:44.594 --> 00:01:48.153
Tor sat on the grass.

27
00:01:48.154 --> 00:01:55.033
A pile of fish sat next to her.

28
00:01:55.034 --> 00:02:06.810
Tor smiled. "Let's have another picnic!"

